identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: "https://github.com/shaozigang/tcm-39class-yolo-lta"
    description: GitHub repository
repository-code: "https://github.com/shaozigang/tcm-39class-yolo-lta"
url: "https://github.com/shaozigang/tcm-39class-yolo-lta"
abstract: >
  Code, twelve-run factorial metrics, bootstrap intervals, figures and analysis
  notebooks for a 39-class plant-derived toxic Chinese herbal medicine image
  classification benchmark. Lightweight attention modules (SE, CBAM, LTA)
  produced no reproducible Top-1 accuracy gain relative to a no-attention
  YOLOv12s-cls baseline across three random seeds.
keywords:
  - toxic Chinese herbal medicine
  - fine-grained image classification
  - attention mechanism
  - reproducibility
  - YOLO
  - EfficientNet
  - bootstrap confidence interval
